# gcloud builds submit uses THIS file (not .dockerignore) to decide what to
# upload as build context. The Dockerfile self-fetches model code + weights from
# GitHub, so the only file the build needs is service.py — exclude everything
# else (esp. the 2.9 GB artifacts/) to keep the upload to a few KB.
*
!service.py
!Dockerfile
!cloudbuild.yaml
